WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.490
Pick a DraftPack,
or write your own topic from scratch.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:08.390
Fine-tune the draft settings,
then invite your friends with one link.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.790
Search or filter to find the pick you want,

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.790
and build your lineup on the clock.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.505
Play DraftLab daily —
fast solo drafting games

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.460
that sharpen your board
and pay XP toward your next level.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.240
The more you play,
the more DraftCoins you earn —

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.170
spend them on XP boosts, avatars,
and Draft Tickets.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:35.050
When the board fills in a casual draft,
every roster is scored on draft-day value.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:39.030
Steals beat chalk, and the winner
is crowned on the spot.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.930
Competitive is where
the experience changes.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.030
First, the board gets sliced —
only about half the pack makes the cut,

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:50.130
so you think fast
and adjust on the fly.

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:53.230
Picks you'd count on in casual
may simply not be there.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.852
And you're not just scored
on today's favorites —

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:01.114
you're scored on
what your picks become.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:04.376
Take a sleeper early, and if it climbs
in popularity across the season,

00:01:04.456 --> 00:01:07.638
that gap pays you. The earlier you were,
the more it's worth.

00:01:07.718 --> 00:01:10.900
Nothing settles until season's end,
when the standings crown the season.

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:15.625
PlayDraft is the home
for drafting and debating —

00:01:15.705 --> 00:01:18.900
build leagues with friends, argue every pick,
and settle it with a share.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:22.330
However a draft ends, the debate doesn't.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.550
Share the outcome and keep it going.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.980
PlayDraft — where friends
can draft anything draftable.
